rt": 138260, "end": 144563, "text": "Y dijo Jehová Dios: No es bueno que el hombre esté solo; le haré ayuda adecuada para él.", "words": [[0, 138260], [2, 138366], [7, 138646], [14, 139126], [20, 139958], [23, 140102], [26, 140302], [32, 140602], [36, 140842], [39, 140982], [46, 141202], [51, 141542], [57, 142563], [60, 142723], [65, 142963], [71, 143283], [80, 143923], [85, 144223]]}, {"verse": 19, "start": 145083, "end": 160577, "text": "Formó, pues, Jehová Dios de la tierra toda bestia del campo, y toda ave de los cielos, y las trajo a Adam, para que viese cómo les había de llamar; y todo lo que Adam llamó a los animales vivientes, ese es su nombre.", "words": [[0, 145083], [7, 145587], [13, 146447], [20, 146967], [25, 147187], [28, 147407], [31, 147527], [38, 147887], [43, 148147], [50, 148707], [54, 148847], [61, 149447], [63, 150007], [68, 150247], [72, 150647], [75, 150787], [79, 150927], [87, 151259], [89, 151590], [93, 151922], [99, 152362], [101, 152542], [107, 152902], [112, 153562], [116, 153742], [122, 154122], [127, 154402], [131, 154582], [137, 154882], [140, 155082], [148, 155811], [150, 155953], [155, 156173], [158, 156433], [162, 156593], [167, 156953], [173, 157513], [175, 157593], [179, 157733], [188, 158093], [199, 159113], [203, 159433], [206, 159733], [209, 159933]]}, {"verse": 20, "start": 160927, "end": 170946, "text": "Y puso Adam nombres a toda bestia y ave de los cielos y a todo animal del campo: mas para Adam no halló ayuda adecuada para él.", "words": [[0, 160927], [2, 161034], [7, 161474], [12, 161934], [20, 162594], [22, 162774], [27, 162934], [34, 163574], [36, 164114], [40, 164254], [43, 164374], [47, 164514], [54, 165214], [56, 165594], [58, 165694], [63, 165854], [70, 166254], [74, 166534], [81, 167528], [85, 167714], [90, 168014], [95, 168536], [98, 168778], [104, 169019], [110, 169419], [119, 170159], [124, 170399]]}, {"verse": 21, "start": 171296, "end": 181867, "text": "Y Jehová Dios hizo caer sueño sobre Adam, y se quedó dormido: entonces tomó una de sus costillas, y cerró la carne en su lugar;", "words": [[0, 171296], [2, 171421], [9, 171961], [14, 172281], [19, 172921], [24, 173421], [30, 173901], [36, 174261], [42, 174781], [44, 175361], [47, 175501], [53, 175921], [62, 176839], [71, 177580], [76, 178140], [80, 178440], [83, 178600], [87, 178780], [98, 179440], [100, 180040], [106, 180420], [109, 180560], [115, 180900], [118, 181140], [121, 181280]]}, {"verse": 22, "start": 182217, "end": 188292, "text": "Y de la costilla que Jehová Dios tomó del hombre, hizo una mujer, y la trajo al hombre.", "words": [[0, 182217], [2, 182357], [5, 182437], [8, 182557], [17, 183177], [21, 183377], [28, 183857], [33, 184057], [38, 184617], [42, 184757], [50, 185557], [55, 185837], [59, 186137], [66, 186537], [68, 187097], [71, 187217], [77, 187617], [80, 187757]]}, {"verse": 23, "start": 188642, "end": 196729, "text": "Y dijo Adam: Esto es ahora hueso de mis huesos, y carne de mi carne: esta será llamada Mujer, porque del hombre fue tomada.", "words": [[0, 188642], [2, 188811], [7, 189051], [13, 189887], [18, 190170], [21, 190370], [27, 190630], [33, 191110], [36, 191190], [40, 191310], [48, 191890], [50, 192070], [56, 192390], [59, 192570], [62, 192670], [69, 193433], [74, 193696], [79, 193956], [87, 194396], [94, 195056], [101, 195416], [105, 195616], [112, 195856], [116, 196096]]}, {"verse": 24, "start": 197009, "end": 204994, "text": "Por tanto, dejará el hombre a su padre y a su madre, y se unirá a su mujer, y serán una sola carne.", "words": [[0, 197009], [4, 197135], [11, 197655], [18, 198455], [21, 198575], [28, 198855], [30, 199015], [33, 199135], [39, 199495], [41, 199835], [43, 199935], [46, 200075], [53, 200395], [55, 200840], [58, 201020], [64, 201720], [66, 201920], [69, 202100], [76, 202540], [78, 203360], [84, 203780], [88, 203980], [93, 204240]]}, {"verse": 25, "start": 205344, "end": 210136, "text": "Y estaban ambos desnudos, Adam y su mujer, y no se avergonzaban.", "words": [[0, 20